xalen-stars-hip-data — DATA LICENSE (non-commercial)

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-NC-3.0-IGO

This crate embeds fixed-star catalogue data derived from:

  - The Hipparcos Main Catalogue (CDS I/239, hip_main.dat), (C) ESA 1997,
    published in "The Hipparcos and Tycho Catalogues" (ESA SP-1200).

The catalogue compilation is distributed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 3.0 IGO licence (CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO). The full legal
code is at:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0/igo/legalcode

KEY TERM: this data may NOT be used for commercial purposes. This crate is an
optional, unpublished add-on (`publish = false`) that no published XALEN crate
depends on; the default star list in `xalen-stars` is built from the Yale
Bright Star Catalogue and the IAU Catalog of Star Names and does not contain
this data. See the repository NOTICE and crates/xalen-stars/README.md.

The surrounding XALEN Ephemeris *code* (including the analytical engine that
consumes this data) is licensed Apache-2.0; this NON-COMMERCIAL restriction
applies to the catalogue DATA in this crate only.

NOTE (pending counsel review): the precise licence designation for this data
(CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO vs. the specific CDS terms of use) is being confirmed. The
restriction is non-commercial either way.
